## Test Setup

| Item | Details |
|---|---|
| Operating system | QNX Neutrino RTOS 8.0 |
| Target | Raspberry Pi 4 (4 CPU cores), connected to Momentics over Ethernet |
| Heartbeat interval | 100 ms |
| Failure timeout | 300 ms (3 missed heartbeats) |
| Overrun rule | 3 consecutive cycles above the 30 ms budget |
| Demo hold | 2 s, display only, **excluded** from all downtime figures |

